      { q: 'What will happen during the event on June 25?', choices: ['The restaurant will reduce its menu prices.', 'The restaurant will offer special menu items.', 'Mr. Marco will celebrate his retirement.', 'The New Haven business community will honor Mr. Marco.'], correct: 1, evidence: '"Guests will enjoy live music and a new tasting menu."', explain: 'Sự kiện khai trương sẽ có các món đặc biệt trong thực đơn nếm thử hoàn toàn mới.' },
      { q: 'In which of the positions marked [1], [2], [3], and [4] does the following sentence best belong?\n"During repairs, some additional dining space was added."', choices: ['[1]', '[2]', '[3]', '[4]'], correct: 0, evidence: 'Câu "During repairs, some additional dining space was added" khớp logic ngay trước câu "The restaurant will accommodate larger parties when it reopens" ở vị trí [1].', explain: 'Có thêm không gian ăn uống trong lúc sửa chữa lý giải vì sao nhà hàng có thể phục vụ đoàn khách lớn hơn ngay sau đó.' }
